lmrs-container (0.1.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Implement the domain layer behind the public commands: the disk model cache
    is backed by the hub cache directory the runtime downloads into, the runtime
    client executes against vLLM, VRAM is measured instead of reported as zero,
    and chat is admitted against measured capacity before it reaches the model.
  * Advertise the version of the installed package instead of the version field
    in /etc/lmrs/config.json, which is a conffile and survives upgrades.
  * Forward the admission and measurement settings into the container, derive
    VLLM_BASE_URL from VLLM_HOST/VLLM_PORT, and report LMCache as enabled from
    the same condition that enables the KV connector.

 -- Vasiliy Zdanovskiy <vasilyvz@gmail.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 15:10:00 +0300
